# Real filings are fetched, not committed: large, someone else's bytes, and a
# corpus in git is a corpus nobody re-fetches when it goes stale. The synthetic
# set IS committed, so CI can prove the harness runs with no credential.
bench/corpus/*/
!bench/corpus/.gitkeep
